return {
    ["%s:\n      我听闻你与异化猎犬遭遇了一场苦战。不必过分担忧。在过去的岁月循环中，我已经明白失败与胜利——乃至生存与死亡——都不过是一时的、相对的：它只是你旅途中的一个普通坐标，用来验证你的成长。谨记面对异化猎犬的诀窍：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302112\">异化猎犬的记载</>\n      对于一位总在路上的旅人来说，我知道让人停下脚步的常常并非挫折本身，而是失去了再次上路的勇气。所幸你并不胆怯于面对更多新冒险，我想下次，我听到的就会是更好的消息。对你这样年轻的非凡者而言，你已经做得很好。\n      如果你需要的话，漫长的时光为我积淀下一些经验，也许对你有用。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查看</>"] = "%s:\n      I heard that you encountered a bitter battle with the Alienated Hound. Do not worry too much. In the cycles of time past, I have come to understand that failure and victory—and even life and death—are merely temporary and relative: they are just ordinary coordinates on your journey, used to verify your growth. Keep in mind the tips for facing the Alienated Hound: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302112\">Records of the Alienated Hound</>\n      For a traveler who is always on the road, I know that what makes people stop is often not the setback itself, but the loss of courage to set off again. Fortunately, you are not timid about facing new adventures, and I think next time, the news I hear will be better. For a young Beyonder like you, you have already done very well. \n      If you need it, the long passage of time has accumulated some experience for me that might be useful to you. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view</>",
    ["1. 打开礼金的玩家需要输入正确的密码才可以领取礼金\n2. 领取绑金礼金的玩家会获得随机数额的绑金\n3. 领取外观馈赠的玩家会获得随机类型的外观道具"] = "1. Players who open the gift need to input the correct password to claim the gift. \n 2. Players who claim bound gold gifts will receive a random amount of bound gold. \n 3. Players who claim appearance gifts will receive a random type of appearance item.",
