    ["<Highlight>接取叹息之种任务后</>，猩红遗物可通过击杀<Highlight>猎龙之城中的超凡生物</>或击败其他敌对玩家<Highlight>掠夺获取</>。当被敌方玩家击杀时，<Highlight>猩红遗物也将按比例掉落</>。\n可将其提交至<Highlight>【猎杀管家】</>处推进<Highlight>猎杀进度</>奖励。<Highlight>猩红遗物仅在猎龙之城内有效</>，离开后将<Highlight>自动失效并清除</>。"] = "<Highlight> After accepting the Seed of Sighs quest </>, Scarlet Relics can be obtained by killing <Highlight> Beyonder creatures in the City of Dragon Hunting </> or by defeating other hostile players <Highlight> to plunder them </>. When killed by an enemy player, <Highlight> Scarlet Relics will also be dropped proportionally </>. \n You can submit them to the <Highlight> [Hunting Butler] </> to advance <Highlight> hunting progress </> rewards. <Highlight> Scarlet Relics are only effective within the City of Dragon Hunting </>; upon leaving, they will <Highlight> automatically expire and be cleared </>.",
